@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Lista de sillones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sillones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alta de un sillón (solo administrador)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sillones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Sillón 1", "bufferMinutos": 10 }

### Detalle de un sillón
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sillones/{{sillonId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modificación parcial (solo administrador)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sillones/{{sillonId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bufferMinutos": 5 }
